---
source: crates/weglarka-daemon/src/metrics/daemon.rs
expression: text
---
# HELP weglarka_app_health_transitions_total Health transitions seen by the crash-loop and healthcheck monitor since the daemon started, by app and new state (crash_looping, unhealthy, recovered).
# TYPE weglarka_app_health_transitions_total counter
weglarka_app_health_transitions_total{app="api",to="recovered"} 1
weglarka_app_health_transitions_total{app="api",to="unhealthy"} 1
# HELP weglarka_deploys_total Deploy attempts since the daemon started, by app and result (ok, failed); a reconcile retry is another attempt. A deploy rolled back after a failed health gate counts in weglarka_rollbacks_total instead.
# TYPE weglarka_deploys_total counter
weglarka_deploys_total{app="web",result="failed"} 1
weglarka_deploys_total{app="web",result="ok"} 1
# HELP weglarka_rollbacks_total Rollbacks to the previous digest since the daemon started, by app and result (ok, failed).
# TYPE weglarka_rollbacks_total counter
weglarka_rollbacks_total{app="api",result="ok"} 1
